</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>LISTS</code></td>
<td><code>128</code></td>
<td>The quick messages, waypoints and DTMF memories by <code>READ_MANY</code> and <code>WRITE_MANY</code> (<code>super::what::QUICK</code>, <code>super::what::WAYPOINT</code>, <code>super::what::DTMF</code>) and <code>SUBSCRIBE</code>'s event log (<code>super::event::SUB_LOG</code>): LINK-54 – LINK-57, decision 327. The byte's last bit: a capability after these goes in a second byte after this one (a client that reads only the first sees none of them).</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
