<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>UP</code></td>
<td><code>0</code></td>
<td>A keypad key let go (as remote PTT's <code>OFF</code>).</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>DOWN</code></td>
<td><code>1</code></td>
