</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>SHORT</code></td>
<td><code>2</code></td>
<td>Pressed and let go: a short press (KEY-3).</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>LONG</code></td>
<td><code>3</code></td>
<td>Held to the long press (KEY-3: 700 ms), then let go: the radio lets it go <code>LONG_HOLD_MS</code> after the answer, and answers <code>busy</code> to keys until then.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>LONG_HOLD_MS</code></td>
<td><code>750</code></td>
<td>How long a remote long press is held.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
