<td>A remote key held down longer than this is let go.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>KNOB</code></td>
<td><code>0x81</code></td>
<td>The knob: then the steps, an i8.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>KNOB_MAX</code></td>
<td><code>20</code></td>
<td>The most knob steps in one <code>KEY</code>.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>LAST_CODE</code></td>
<td><code>21</code></td>
<td>The last keypad code (stock's 0-21); 24 up are the PTTs, never keys here.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>PTT</code></td>
<td><code>0x80</code></td>
